---
date: 2026-09-01
tags: [release]
title: Version 0.0.11 released
type: posts
---


## Changes:

- implemented rate limits on login
- rename base package to make the adjustment of logging work
- added password validation with min length check
- minor performance tweaks 
  - lowered JDBC max pool size 
  - enabled virtual threads
- minor security fixes
  - removed cacheing of null results to avoid cache poisoning
  - added check to avoid that target and source cannot be the base url (cyclic redirects)
	
## Breaking Changes:

- authentication is now active by default


**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/re-Director/re-director/compare/0.0.11...v0.1.0